<title>USA: Central Newspapers Feb revenues up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Central Newspapers Feb revenues up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Newspapers Inc said on Thursday that its February revenues rose 18 percent to $52.4 million from $44.4 million in the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>For the year to date, the media company said revenues advanced 11.3 percent to $98.9 million from $88.8 million.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
